WEBVTT

00:09.770 --> 00:10.860
Ohmi.

00:13.640 --> 00:14.700
Ah, the crow.

00:17.780 --> 00:20.080
Let's see what you've got...

00:20.780 --> 00:21.880
Snake.

00:41.040 --> 00:43.040
When did I first notice

00:43.040 --> 00:45.040
That your fingers were

00:45.040 --> 00:48.700
So beautiful

00:49.010 --> 00:52.710
And when did I notice this feeling?

00:53.050 --> 00:56.020
So fast that I'll be run over

00:56.020 --> 00:58.620
I cannot keep up

00:58.620 --> 01:01.960
My fearful heart

01:01.960 --> 01:04.720
Puts on the brakes

01:05.160 --> 01:07.530
Our eyes meet

01:08.400 --> 01:09.530
We talk about something

01:09.530 --> 01:12.730
When you look at me

01:13.030 --> 01:17.470
I cannot move

01:19.070 --> 01:26.740
My beating heart is about to break

01:27.050 --> 01:30.990
The arms that catch me pull me

01:30.990 --> 01:35.060
I can't suppress it, I can't express it

01:35.060 --> 01:39.720
That I like you

01:40.060 --> 01:43.030
So much it hurts

01:43.030 --> 01:50.730
The beginning of a love that won't let me breathe

01:57.580 --> 01:58.550
Appear!

02:03.420 --> 02:07.420
The Truth

02:03.420 --> 02:07.420
Behind the

02:03.420 --> 02:07.420
Tears

02:06.990 --> 02:07.860
Ohmi!

02:08.160 --> 02:09.120
Appear!

02:12.630 --> 02:13.250
Mahiro!

02:16.330 --> 02:17.230
Burn!

02:26.940 --> 02:27.810
Wow.

02:27.810 --> 02:29.440
I want to eat him.

02:33.650 --> 02:35.880
That was dangerous, damn it!

02:37.350 --> 02:40.120
Ohmi, tell me the truth.

02:40.120 --> 02:42.320
Isn't it all an act?

02:42.320 --> 02:44.290
All for the purpose of taking back the Artifacts?

02:45.290 --> 02:47.890
You still have such naive ideas?

02:54.040 --> 02:54.970
Yuichi!

03:02.680 --> 03:05.710
I'm all right with you losing your lives here,

03:05.710 --> 03:08.010
but I cannot bring myself to do it to former friends.

03:09.020 --> 03:11.280
Go home and tell the others:

03:12.050 --> 03:15.150
Never strike at Logos again.

03:18.390 --> 03:23.260
Either we will take the Onikirimaru or you will hand it over to us.

03:23.670 --> 03:26.260
The result is the same either way.

03:27.170 --> 03:29.760
The only thing left will be the Tamayori princess' life.

03:34.210 --> 03:36.540
Think it over carefully.

03:42.650 --> 03:44.140
What a cowardly bunch.

03:44.650 --> 03:46.020
But that Ohmi...

03:47.190 --> 03:50.650
What could he be thinking?

03:54.730 --> 03:57.270
Why is Logos' presence so close?

03:57.270 --> 03:58.490
The Onikirimaru?!

03:59.770 --> 04:00.700
Takuma?

04:02.600 --> 04:04.540
Damn it...

04:06.410 --> 04:09.500
<i>The three gods said to the Tamayori princess,</i>

04:10.380 --> 04:13.580
<i>"Teach us how to banish the Oni.</i>

04:13.580 --> 04:15.280
<i>Someday,</i>

04:15.280 --> 04:17.840
<i>it will become a monster that swallows the world."</i>

04:18.290 --> 04:21.160
<i>They fought with the Oni for seven days and seven nights.</i>

04:21.160 --> 04:24.150
<i>The Youko and Orochi lost their lives</i>

04:24.460 --> 04:26.490
<i>and the Oni was destroyed.</i>

04:27.260 --> 04:28.860
You're not planning...

04:29.400 --> 04:31.870
on burdening yourself with everyone, are you?

04:32.270 --> 04:33.270
Takuma!

04:33.270 --> 04:34.330
Step back.

04:35.240 --> 04:38.400
Demon, step back from the Tamayori princess.

04:38.770 --> 04:40.260
Grandma!

04:40.610 --> 04:41.630
Quickly.

04:44.780 --> 04:47.540
I knew as soon as I saw you.

04:48.550 --> 04:52.150
Takuma, you must stay away from Tamaki.

04:52.490 --> 04:54.390
Grandma, wait.

04:54.390 --> 04:56.520
This is the Onikirimaru's fault.

04:57.060 --> 05:00.400
If we could just contain the Onikirimaru's power...

05:00.400 --> 05:02.090
And when will that be?

05:03.500 --> 05:07.630
You cannot seal away the Onikirimaru's power as you are now.

05:08.970 --> 05:12.410
You don't even know what to do to seal its power.

05:12.970 --> 05:16.310
The gods are restless and Logos is back...

05:18.010 --> 05:19.040
Takuma.

05:21.150 --> 05:24.290
You and the Onikirimaru are opposite sides of each other.

05:24.290 --> 05:28.280
While at once being your opposite, strength also calls forth greater strength.

05:29.160 --> 05:32.790
If the Onikirimaru awakens at the Tamayori princess' side,

05:33.630 --> 05:35.430
you will become a demon.

05:36.030 --> 05:37.770
If you become a demon,

05:37.770 --> 05:40.440
the Onikirimaru will gain catastrophic power.

05:40.440 --> 05:41.630
Stop it, Grandma!

05:41.970 --> 05:44.310
I'll do something for Takuma.

05:44.310 --> 05:46.140
Just before, I was able to drive back-

05:46.140 --> 05:50.700
Just because you've driven it back once doesn't mean you can do it every time.

05:52.380 --> 05:55.150
On the contrary, it can cause him to go wild.

05:55.550 --> 05:58.320
Your awakening is not complete.

05:59.650 --> 06:04.420
Tamaki, right now you are attempting to awaken the demon inside of Takuma.

06:05.730 --> 06:07.360
It is fine now.

06:07.360 --> 06:11.530
But soon Takuma will lose his humanity,

06:11.530 --> 06:14.700
and will bare his fangs to the Tamayori princess.

06:15.040 --> 06:18.600
Eventually he will catch the Tamayori and attempt to kill her.

06:19.670 --> 06:21.010
I'll...

06:21.580 --> 06:23.200
kill Tamaki?

06:25.110 --> 06:26.050
Takuma!

06:26.050 --> 06:27.310
Takuma Onizaki!

06:27.720 --> 06:30.350
I'm placing you under suspension.

06:30.350 --> 06:32.220
Leave this place immediately.

06:33.390 --> 06:36.790
You mustn't approach the Tamayori princess or the Onikirimaru again.

06:37.760 --> 06:38.660
That's...!

06:38.660 --> 06:41.860
That is what is necessary for Tamaki as well.

06:44.830 --> 06:45.730
No!

06:45.730 --> 06:49.170
Tamaki... No, Tamayori princess.

06:50.300 --> 06:53.300
You are not responsible for only yourself anymore.

06:55.680 --> 06:57.940
If what Lady Baba says is true...

06:59.550 --> 07:02.570
I should not be here.

07:07.360 --> 07:09.520
No, I mustn't be here.

07:11.290 --> 07:12.660
Takuma!

07:11.790 --> 07:12.660
Tamaki!

07:23.670 --> 07:24.700
Mitsuru.

07:26.140 --> 07:27.770
Take Tamaki to her room.

07:28.210 --> 07:31.700
Keep an eye on her so she doesn't do something selfish.

07:33.110 --> 07:34.140
Yes.

07:38.220 --> 07:39.950
Tamaki, this way.

07:48.300 --> 07:49.760
There must be...

07:49.760 --> 07:51.700
a nicer way of putting that.

07:57.170 --> 08:00.900
No matter what or how you say it, what must be done is the same.

08:02.240 --> 08:03.910
Well, that's true.

08:05.680 --> 08:08.020
So, those with your blood...

08:08.020 --> 08:10.540
are ready to offer themselves to the Onikirimaru?

08:11.150 --> 08:15.060
I've lived only for the purpose of maintaining the seal.

08:17.530 --> 08:19.290
Why must you bring this up now?

08:24.130 --> 08:25.390
More than Logos,

08:27.030 --> 08:31.230
I'm most afraid of you.

08:31.840 --> 08:33.930
If I were to speak the truth...

08:48.390 --> 08:49.890
What is it?

08:49.890 --> 08:54.630
I was just thinking how cunning you are, like a snake.

08:54.630 --> 08:56.530
I like you.

08:57.100 --> 09:01.800
Those inexperienced guardians will likely suffer.

09:02.300 --> 09:05.470
The only card they hold is their naive courage.

09:05.470 --> 09:07.640
It's too much of a disadvantage.

09:07.640 --> 09:11.410
With this, we will be able to suppress their movements for a while.

09:13.810 --> 09:16.150
Could I ask you a favor?

09:16.450 --> 09:17.320
A favor?

09:17.990 --> 09:20.050
A bodyguard for Aria.

09:20.050 --> 09:24.260
Eins, Zwei, and I have been called to the convening of the four wise men.

09:24.260 --> 09:26.560
We have to return to the main branch.

09:27.560 --> 09:29.660
Is that all you want?

09:30.060 --> 09:31.100
Yes.

09:31.100 --> 09:34.870
Stay by her side and offer her comfort and consolation.

09:35.200 --> 09:39.230
She'll probably ask you about the guardians.

09:41.340 --> 09:43.210
I'm counting on you, Snake.

09:44.810 --> 09:47.110
I know. While I'm there,

09:47.110 --> 09:50.280
I'll get the four wise men's seal of approval.

09:50.280 --> 09:53.910
If I do, even Monado Aria will have to obey me.

09:55.360 --> 09:55.950
Drei.

09:57.560 --> 10:01.620
With you gone, will the
Artifacts be all right?

10:02.860 --> 10:03.990
Does it bother you?

10:07.070 --> 10:09.970
Don't worry. I've hidden them,

10:09.970 --> 10:12.940
somewhere that is and isn't here.

10:22.820 --> 10:23.940
Excuse me.

10:24.790 --> 10:25.780
Mitsuru.

10:27.290 --> 10:29.420
I'm terribly sorry, Tamaki.

10:30.260 --> 10:33.490
I can only obey Lady Baba's orders.

10:34.730 --> 10:37.930
Please, do as Lady Baba instructs.

10:38.500 --> 10:42.270
Don't go out beyond the temple grounds.

10:43.200 --> 10:45.570
Does that mean I can't go to school?

10:46.140 --> 10:47.940
I'm terribly sorry.

10:48.310 --> 10:51.280
In order for Onizaki to remain Onizaki,

10:51.810 --> 10:54.250
I think it is better for you not to meet.

10:56.320 --> 10:57.380
I understand.

11:02.290 --> 11:03.320
It's all right.

11:03.320 --> 11:06.690
Now that I know about
Takuma and the Onikirimaru,

11:06.690 --> 11:08.790
and about Shinji and Suguru...

11:09.300 --> 11:12.890
Now that I know the truth about everything, I feel better.

11:15.270 --> 11:16.760
I'm telling the truth.

11:18.240 --> 11:21.940
To not even know how to seal the Onikirimaru...

11:23.040 --> 11:24.950
I really am a failure as a Tamayori princess.

11:25.650 --> 11:29.420
But as the Tamayori princess, if I can awaken completely,

11:29.420 --> 11:32.150
and seal away the Onikirimaru properly,

11:32.150 --> 11:36.060
Takuma and everyone else won't have to worry or suffer.

11:37.760 --> 11:39.090
Isn't that right?

11:49.670 --> 11:50.540
Lady Baba!

11:52.740 --> 11:53.910
Ashiya!

11:53.910 --> 11:55.480
Welcome home.

11:55.480 --> 11:57.450
Looks like they really got you.

11:57.910 --> 11:59.180
Are you all right?

12:00.210 --> 12:02.450
We have nothing to say to you.

12:03.650 --> 12:05.050
Scary, scary.

12:07.320 --> 12:09.120
This place is full of scary people.

12:11.190 --> 12:12.320
Take care!

12:15.730 --> 12:18.000
What an unsightly pair.

12:20.300 --> 12:21.860
We met with Ohmi.

12:22.670 --> 12:23.840
And?

12:23.840 --> 12:25.640
He told us to hand over the Onikirimaru.

12:27.840 --> 12:29.180
Ohmi.

12:29.180 --> 12:31.700
What does he think the
Shugogo House bonds are?

12:32.410 --> 12:35.620
Asking us to hand over the Onikirimaru that we've always protected...

12:35.620 --> 12:36.980
What is that?

12:38.920 --> 12:40.220
What foolishness.

12:41.590 --> 12:43.580
Good work, both of you.

12:44.190 --> 12:46.090
That's enough about Suguru.

12:47.360 --> 12:48.730
Lady Baba, what are you...?

12:49.730 --> 12:52.600
The important thing is the sealing of the Onikirimaru.

12:52.930 --> 12:56.030
As long as it is in this temple, the Onikirimaru is safe.

12:56.540 --> 12:58.670
There is no worry of having it stolen.

12:59.240 --> 13:02.210
It is protected by a number of powerful barriers.

13:02.740 --> 13:04.870
Are you telling us to forget about Ohmi?

13:05.410 --> 13:09.210
Is there anything you two can do about Suguru?

13:09.780 --> 13:12.340
He's already made up his mind.

13:15.590 --> 13:20.120
Until further ordered, don't go out by yourself.

13:21.060 --> 13:23.760
If I need you, I'll send Mitsuru for you.

13:25.100 --> 13:26.590
What did Tamaki say?

13:27.000 --> 13:28.990
I'd like to speak with Tamaki, just once.

13:30.270 --> 13:31.770
For what purpose?

13:31.770 --> 13:34.260
What will you accomplish by meeting with Tamaki?

13:35.680 --> 13:38.200
I have ordered Tamaki to stay in the house.

13:39.010 --> 13:41.320
During that time, we will wait for her

13:41.320 --> 13:43.940
to completely awaken as the Tamayori princess.

13:44.190 --> 13:48.760
Guardians, you must not disrupt the Tamayori princess.

13:48.760 --> 13:50.420
House arrest?

13:50.420 --> 13:52.150
You won't let her leave here?

13:52.460 --> 13:53.490
And Takuma?

13:53.490 --> 13:55.490
I've sent him home.

13:57.130 --> 13:59.000
Did he accept that?

14:00.130 --> 14:03.100
It is not a question of whether he accepted it or not.

14:03.440 --> 14:05.340
This is about the Tamayori princess.

14:06.840 --> 14:08.000
Lady Baba...

14:08.780 --> 14:11.050
By thinking not of the
Tamayori princess,

14:11.050 --> 14:13.450
and doing as he pleases,

14:13.450 --> 14:17.320
he has denied his responsibilities as a guardian.

14:18.190 --> 14:21.880
Now do what you must do, as guardians.

14:30.200 --> 14:31.730
Aria,

14:31.730 --> 14:35.070
I have been called to an audience with the four wise men,

14:35.070 --> 14:37.200
and must leave for the main branch.

14:38.240 --> 14:39.370
Is that right?

14:39.810 --> 14:41.940
Considering the journey,

14:41.940 --> 14:45.310
I will bring along Eins and Zwei,

14:45.310 --> 14:48.480
but I will leave him to guard you.

14:49.320 --> 14:52.380
You are one of the guardians.

14:53.390 --> 14:55.890
You have no need to worry.

14:55.890 --> 15:00.890
He is now an excellent servant to you.

15:01.260 --> 15:02.920
I am pleased to make your acquaintance.

15:06.270 --> 15:09.570
<i>If what Lady Baba says is true...</i>

15:09.570 --> 15:12.630
<i>I shouldn't be here.</i>

15:15.940 --> 15:18.210
It's no good. I can't concentrate.

15:20.210 --> 15:23.050
What am I doing at a time like this?

15:26.420 --> 15:28.480
I'm going to get some air.

15:32.030 --> 15:33.830
What is it?

15:33.830 --> 15:35.190
I'll tell you everything.

15:37.000 --> 15:39.360
About my time with Logos.

15:39.730 --> 15:41.470
The reason behind my betrayal.

15:41.470 --> 15:44.440
Everything I know about the Logos I met.

15:45.610 --> 15:47.840
I did it because I thought it was right.

15:48.280 --> 15:50.570
But that was a mistake.

15:51.210 --> 15:53.250
On top of being weak and powerless,

15:53.250 --> 15:54.580
I've made a mistake.

15:55.620 --> 15:59.080
I don't think that confessing redeems me in any way.

16:00.020 --> 16:01.160
However,

16:01.160 --> 16:03.460
I thought it was necessary for me to tell you.

16:03.460 --> 16:05.050
Shinji Inukai.

16:05.630 --> 16:09.090
I do not care what you were thinking.

16:09.430 --> 16:12.330
The important thing is whether you fulfill your duty.

16:13.130 --> 16:17.640
I called you back and employed you as a guardian,

16:17.640 --> 16:20.630
but it appears you were unable to fulfill your duty.

16:22.280 --> 16:26.040
I suppose you were a Kotokura all along.

16:27.510 --> 16:30.640
Shinji, you and Mitsuru are...

16:47.470 --> 16:48.700
Shinji.

17:00.810 --> 17:03.050
Shinji, what happened?

17:04.050 --> 17:08.580
Nothing. I just realized that I'm talentless.

17:09.320 --> 17:10.950
That's not...

17:14.160 --> 17:16.360
When you came back, Shinji,

17:17.600 --> 17:21.040
I could only act coldly towards you.

17:23.140 --> 17:25.500
You had gotten to go out.

17:25.910 --> 17:31.350
I wanted you to be free from the fate of the guardian.

17:32.180 --> 17:35.550
But I also had happy feelings,

17:37.120 --> 17:39.780
thinking that I could be by your side again...

17:41.360 --> 17:42.790
I know.

17:43.160 --> 17:48.120
Just how hard you trained your spoken word.

17:50.200 --> 17:54.290
Just how much you value the other guardians.

17:54.900 --> 17:55.740
Just how much-

17:55.740 --> 17:56.900
Stop it!

17:58.840 --> 18:04.180
I know that I'm still not good enough to be guardian.

18:05.250 --> 18:11.550
So I want you to stop comforting me like that.

18:18.060 --> 18:19.490
Shinji.

18:22.530 --> 18:26.860
To me, Shinji, you are more amazing than anyone.

18:28.040 --> 18:31.670
Since long, long ago, I...

18:42.580 --> 18:43.710
Sorry.

18:47.320 --> 18:49.690
I can't. I just can't.

18:50.420 --> 18:53.090
Mitsuru, you and I are...

18:53.430 --> 18:58.130
<i>You and Mitsuru are twins.</i>

19:00.830 --> 19:03.500
The reason I'm not strong enough,

19:03.500 --> 19:05.840
the reason I was returned to the village,

19:05.840 --> 19:07.570
and your feelings...

19:07.570 --> 19:10.570
I never knew anything.

19:15.320 --> 19:20.080
From now on, my feelings for you will never change.

19:21.820 --> 19:26.820
Starting tomorrow, let's go back to how we always were.

19:33.930 --> 19:34.730
Yes.

19:58.130 --> 19:59.560
Tamaki.

19:59.560 --> 20:01.400
What's wrong, Mitsuru?

20:01.400 --> 20:03.360
Did something happen between you and Shinji?

20:04.500 --> 20:08.330
I've hurt Shinji.

20:10.800 --> 20:13.710
I pushed my feelings for him onto him,

20:13.710 --> 20:17.440
and forced him to bear that weight.

20:18.180 --> 20:19.480
Mitsuru...

20:24.050 --> 20:30.390
I think that liking someone can be full of suffering and pain,

20:30.390 --> 20:34.160
but I want to believe it's a good thing.

20:34.830 --> 20:38.560
I don't want to turn those feelings into a lie.

20:40.570 --> 20:45.570
Is there someone you like, Tamaki?

20:45.570 --> 20:46.800
Yeah...

20:47.170 --> 20:50.910
But because I'm here,
I'm causing him to suffer.

20:53.350 --> 20:56.320
Even though I value him so much.

20:56.320 --> 20:59.650
Even though I don't want to hurt him or cause him to suffer...

21:00.590 --> 21:03.250
Just by being near him...

21:03.890 --> 21:07.220
I start to wonder why I'm even here.

21:08.760 --> 21:10.800
But I'm the Tamayori princess,

21:10.800 --> 21:13.030
and I should be thinking about all these other things...

21:14.670 --> 21:16.660
But I just can't.

21:19.140 --> 21:21.310
Oh... that's weird.

21:21.310 --> 21:23.240
Why am I crying?

21:23.240 --> 21:25.610
I'm sorry. I'm no good.

21:29.880 --> 21:32.410
Please don't say that.

21:33.990 --> 21:35.550
Mitsuru...

21:40.990 --> 21:50.570
The red sky stains time itself as it envelops us

21:50.570 --> 21:59.310
Did you hug me back so tightly because you're worried?

21:59.880 --> 22:04.990
Tell me everything about the dream you had

22:04.990 --> 22:09.460
That you just started to say, but stopped yourself

22:09.460 --> 22:14.590
We drew each other closer with clumsy hands

22:14.590 --> 22:21.370
Let's embrace the sign guiding us to the same future

22:21.370 --> 22:30.980
Only you, only you, will I swear to love through it all

22:30.980 --> 22:40.850
So keep that smile I want to protect beside me always

22:40.850 --> 22:50.460
I'm sure it was inevitable that
I would feel your tears

22:50.460 --> 22:58.910
So I'll become a breeze that blows on your eyes

22:58.910 --> 23:04.570
I promise you

23:16.760 --> 23:18.330
What a wonderful aroma.

23:18.330 --> 23:20.120
The tea is Earl Grey.

23:22.600 --> 23:24.660
I wanted to talk with you.

23:25.630 --> 23:27.970
I'm sure the feeling is mutual.

23:40.080 --> 23:43.980
My owner smells lovely as always.

23:44.950 --> 23:48.750
I want to always be able to enjoy your scent.

23:51.590 --> 23:52.790
All right?

23:55.100 --> 24:00.970
Next Time: The Deceitful Heart
